 farmer opens a gate before sunrise, guiding a measured share toward thirsty rows. In town, walkers pause along the embankment, drawn by the steady sound beneath traffic.\n\nThe river also keeps harder histories. Flood marks remain on warehouse bricks. Rusted bolts show where an old mill wheel turned. Beneath a quiet bend lie branches, bottles, coins, and perhaps names no map records. Water covers these things, but does not erase them. It carries traces forward, breaking them into stories too scattered to recover.\n\nBy evening, the river darkens first. Cottonwoods become silhouettes, and windows along the shore kindle one by one. The current holds each reflection briefly, stretching gold into trembling lines, then releases it. Beyond the last houses, it bends through reeds and disappears.\n\nStill, disappearance is only distance. The river continues under stars, joining wider water, bearing cold, silt, seeds, and moonlight toward a sea it has never seen.`;\ntext((s.match(/\\b[\\w\u2019'-]+\\b/g)||[]).length);", "status": "completed"}], "error": null, "incomplete_details": null, "tool_choice": "auto", "parallel_tool_calls": false, "prompt_cache_key": "01a159c1-fa5d-71a0-8aa4-e7750f105fa9", "prompt_cache_retention": "24h", "prompt_cache_options": {"ttl": "30m", "mode": "implicit", "comparison_response_id": "resp_06efd4d206f98dd3016ad77d770c8c819ab5c1d6a12ea90383"}, "prompt_cache_diagnostics": {"type": "unavailable"}, "text": {"format": {"type": "text"}, "verbosity": "low"}, "top_p": 0.98, "top_logprobs": 0, "temperature": 1.0, "reasoning": {"effort": "low", "context": "all_turns", "summary": null, "mode": "standard"}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 21452, "input_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 20608, "cache_write_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 424, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 22}, "total_tokens": 21876, "attribution": {"items": {"amsg_01a159c2-1810-74d2-a720-53de6ff17176": {"input_tokens": 71, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "output_tokens